# Scanning, as Ubuntu has it: SANE with HP's drivers (hplip, in
# printing) and driverless network and USB scanners (eSCL and WSD:
# sane-airscan; ipp-usb, in printing). How SANE finds its drivers is
# in packages/sane-backends/package.nami. desktop lists this.
packages:
  - sane-backends
  - sane-airscan
